# DXVK and the Vulkan stack under it (aoe2: Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition renders through DXVK 3.1.1 on
# KosmicKrisp), sourced by wine-arm64/build.sh. Apart from wine-arm64/pins, so that Wine's and FEX's series don't change
# with these.
# Khronos' Vulkan headers and loader: libvulkan.1.dylib, which Wine's winevulkan loads; the loader is built against the
# headers (both at their 1.4.341 update, 2026-01-23).
VULKAN_HEADERS_REPO=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers.git
VULKAN_HEADERS_COMMIT=b5c8f996196ba4aa6d8f97e52b5d3b6e70f7e4e2
VULKAN_LOADER_REPO=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Loader.git
VULKAN_LOADER_COMMIT=32fcb949e253cbeb40cda7ea76122b492db579ae
# KosmicKrisp, Mesa's Vulkan driver on Metal: shadexternals' Mesa, at the commit their mesa-kosmickrisp recipe pinned
# (bac93e0, 2026-09-27: geometry shaders advertised). The patches in wine-arm64/patches/mesa apply on top: two
# from dappermint/winecx-gptk (Nilton Perim Neto) and MacNeutron's own.
MESA_REPO=https://github.com/shadexternals/mesa.git
MESA_COMMIT=063dfaeec5d244478139504adf79a962c0e7c2e7
# The Python modules Mesa's build scripts import, installed into a virtual environment for the build only.
MESA_PYTHON_MODULES="Mako==1.3.10 PyYAML==6.0.3 packaging==25.0"
# DXVK (Direct3D 8-11 on Vulkan), built as ARM64EC from the tag's commit and its submodules.
DXVK_REPO=https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk.git
DXVK_TAG=v3.1.1
DXVK_COMMIT=b1a1c99ab52b687cf950d62c88bc2fa316b41663
